# Erlang: Erlang Reference Manual (OTP 26), "Data Types", "Expressions", "Preprocessor"; requirements/languages/erlang.md
name     erlang erl

keyword  after and andalso band begin bnot bor bsl bsr bxor case catch cond div end fun if let maybe
keyword  not of or orelse receive rem try when xor
builtin  true false undefined ok error self spawn send length hd tl element setelement is_atom is_list
builtin  is_integer is_binary atom_to_list list_to_atom io lists maps

line-comment   %
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes name
escape        : x=2 octal=3
sigil    ?    : meta
operators  +-*/=<>!|:#
upper-type
calls
